#This files contains the table for CO cooling
# It follows the approach by Neufeld+Kaufman 1993 (bit.ly/1vnjcXV, see eqn.5).
# The data are kindly provided by K.Omukai (Nov.2014)
# See also Omukai+2010 (bit.ly/1HIaGcn)
#The first three columns are the positions in the arrays
# the 4th is log10(Tgas/K), 5th is log10((nH2+nH)/cm-3),
# the 6th is the CO column density, i.e. log10(NCO/cm-2),
# while the last is the cooling log10(cool), with cool in erg/s/cm3

